1178 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 511 0 R
/T (When I reached home that night...  I placed the case file on the top shelf of my bookcase.  I told myself I'd never open it again.  Some stories deserve to stay finished.  I switched off the light.  Closed the door.  And walked away.  Outside, the city carried on as if nothing had happened. Maybe that's what justice looked like.  Not celebration.  Not revenge.  Just...  another sunrise for the peoplewho were still alive. )
