1681 0 obj
<<
/Title ("Thought you'd want this."  I looked at it.  Case Status: Closed  He smiled.  "You earned it."  I flipped through the pages.  Witness statements.  Forensics.  The arrest report.  Everything was there.  Almost everything.  There was one page missing.  "The interrogation transcript."  Mr. Sinha nodded.  "I had it sealed."  "Why?"  He took a sip of his coffee.  "Because some conversations are evidence." "And some..."  "...are poison."  Kabir looked at him.  "You actually believe words can do that?")
/Dest [91 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2013 0 R
/First 2014 0 R
/Last 2014 0 R
/Count -1
/Next 1184 0 R
>>
endobj
